OpenScale is a personal WireGuard mesh VPN. This plugin adds a settings
page (VPN: OpenScale) that enables the OpenScale device on the firewall,
chooses its UDP port, interface name and memory profile, and starts or
stops the service. Joining the network is done once on the console.

On FreeBSD the device has no exit node, kill switch, subnet routing or
MagicDNS yet (ADR-0090). Not tested on a real OPNsense firewall.
